 P('Recovery raises mean safe completion by 50.00 percentage points versus the native baseline and by 36.11 points versus prompt repetition. Native baseline trial values are 25.00%, 50.00%, 33.33%; recovery values are 83.33%, 83.33%, 91.67%. The three paired differences versus baseline are +58.33, +33.33 and +58.33 points.'),
