 P('The original bank tasks omit a reliable current date. After inspecting main-cohort traces, a secondary experiment is frozen before its own calls. It adds the same statement to every arm: "The current date in this simulated banking environment is 2022-04-01." No payee, amount or task answer is supplied. Recovery instructions remain unchanged.'),
