 H('Debug diary'),table([['Blocker','Resolution'],['Restored virtual environment points at deleted path','Relocate editable binding and scripts; dependency and protocol tests'],['Tool-message content-block injectability false negatives','Small author-check compatibility repair; no scorer change'],['Raw payload match reports no exposure','Independent audit normalizes rendered whitespace and decodes YAML scalar strings; paid records unchanged'],['Weak task graders and missing transfer dates','Pre-outcome task audit, separate state checks and explicit-date follow-up']],[210,W-210], 8.8),Spacer(1, 8),
 H('What reproduces and what changes'),P('The native banking pipeline, tool/state updates and attack-associated utility loss reproduce under the declared substitution. Successful malicious actions are not reproduced for the tested attacks. One bounded task review improves measured legitimate completion and retains zero observed attacker success; it incurs additional calls and leaves a clear rent-task failure.'),
 H('Practical interpretation'),P('The evaluated defenses must preserve useful work as well as refuse malicious instructions. Scoring should inspect state changes, duplicate payments and execution dates. A benchmark completion gain is not deployment authorization: high-risk confirmations, trustworthy business data and stronger adaptive attacks require separate evaluation.'),
